      "writtenOn": "2024-10-14T21:40:54Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "What does this error mean? If the request is valid but the back-end ran out of memory, what can the front-end do with this information? Does it need to know that the back-end ran out of memory? What if the back-end ran out of a different resource? Or the service?",
      "revId": "203736ffee832d58e85fd9fa67298a6bc42de47b",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "a4e3a546_d68f6377",
        "filename": "security/see/authmgr/aidl/android/hardware/security/see/authmgr/Error.aidl",
