        "id": 1678423
      },
      "writtenOn": "2024-10-14T23:27:06Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I understand your point that the front-end may not be able to do anything with this information. But since this is a specific category of error, I think it is useful to identify it with a separate error code rather than throwing the generic \"InternalError\" code.\nBoth Keymint (https://cs.android.com/android/platform/superproject/+/master:hardware/interfaces/security/keymint/aidl/android/hardware/security/keymint/ErrorCode.aidl;l\u003d68) and AuthGraph (https://cs.android.com/android/platform/superproject/main/+/main:hardware/interfaces/security/authgraph/aidl/android/hardware/security/authgraph/Error.aidl;l\u003d48) have this error code in the AIDL definition, so I used the same here as well.\n\nPlease let me know if you prefer to throw the error code: \"InternalError\" for OOM errors. Thanks!",
      "parentUuid": "f7b034e3_ea99efbd",
      "revId": "203736ffee832d58e85fd9fa67298a6bc42de47b",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
