      "writtenOn": "2024-10-11T16:29:26Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "It could be clearer to state this in the form of an assumption along with the IPC assumptions above. We assume the AuthMgr-FE has a trusted mechanism for discovering and establishing a connection to AuthMgr-BE so that mutual authentication is not needed.",
